296
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:55,000
No drive, no copay.

297
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,500
They say twenty minutes.

298
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,930
I did thirty,

299
00:07:57,930 --> 00:07:58,970
twice a day,

300
00:07:58,970 --> 00:08:01,400
lowest setting that first
week.

301
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:02,830
Once before my shift,

302
00:08:02,830 --> 00:08:04,050
once after supper.

303
00:08:04,090 --> 00:08:05,560
I put it on the calendar.

304
00:08:05,710 --> 00:08:06,910
The first week,

305
00:08:06,910 --> 00:08:07,770
I couldn't have told

306
00:08:07,770 --> 00:08:09,420
