week

310
00:08:13,450 --> 00:08:14,400
and then stop.

311
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:16,100
But somewhere in the
second week

312
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:17,170
I noticed I'd come down

313
00:08:17,170 --> 00:08:18,880
