surgery is over.

337
00:08:56,590 --> 00:08:57,240
Two.

338
00:08:57,580 --> 00:08:59,710
Inflamed tissue holds
extra fluid,

339
00:08:59,710 --> 00:09:00,690
so it takes up more

340
00:09:00,690 --> 00:09:01,970
