341
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:02,880
Three.

342
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:04,740
There's only so much room
in there.

343
00:09:04,780 --> 00:09:06,380
Bending compresses it.

344
00:09:06,550 --> 00:09:08,280
Straightening pulls it
tight.

345
00:09:08,770 --> 00:09:10,200
That's the squeeze.

346
00:09:10,330 --> 00:09:10,970
Four.

347
00:09:11,010 --> 00:09:12,600
Red and near-infrared
light have been

348
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:15,140
studied for calming that
inflammation,

349
00:09:15,140 --> 00:09:16,550
so the swelling and the
pressure

350
00:09:16,550 --> 00:09:17,710
can come down with it.

351
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:19,530
In a randomized trial,

352
00:09:19,530 --> 00:09:21,270
patients given light
therapy after

353
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:23,670
a knee replacement had
less pain,

354
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:26,230
less swelling and better
early movement

355
00:09:26,230 --> 00:09:27,400
than those who weren't.

356
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:30,800
A 2025 review said the
same,

357
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:32,120
and was clear the evidence

358
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,240
is still limited.

359
00:09:33,490 --> 00:09:34,800
I probably sound like a
broken

360
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:35,830
