361
00:09:35,830 --> 00:09:37,150
and the guys on my crew.

362
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:39,300
But after two years of
doing everything

363
00:09:39,300 --> 00:09:41,240
I was told and getting
nowhere,

364
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,520
you have no idea what it's

365
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:44,110
