night,

366
00:09:44,110 --> 00:09:45,500
say yes to the walk,

367
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:46,870
and get my life back.

368
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,450
So take it from me.

369
00:09:48,620 --> 00:09:50,100
Don't spend another year
waiting

370
00:09:50,100 --> 00:09:51,090
